# `**/` so nested copies are excluded too: a host install or build leaking into
# COPY would overwrite the clean in-image install or ship a stale bundle.
**/node_modules
**/build
# Monaco bundle copied by scripts/copy-monaco.mjs; its version stamp must come
# from the in-image install, not the host.
**/public/monaco
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
.claude
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
